#: b14b55f42ece43cdad34c1ba4768c410
msgid "支持带 CP2K 签名的 `.out` / `.log` 主输出。"
msgstr "Main `.out` / `.log` files containing a CP2K signature are supported."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:89
#: 327401b820014d7ba4d53da0f7f481bc
msgid ""
"当前入口只支持包含一组坐标和一组力的三维周期单点输出；优化或 MD 的多步历史应"
"先转换为 EXTXYZ，不能直接把多个坐标块拼成一个结构。"
msgstr ""
"This entry point currently supports only three-dimensional periodic single-"
"point output containing one coordinate block and one force block. Convert "
"multi-step optimization or MD histories to EXTXYZ first; multiple coordinate "
"blocks are never concatenated into one structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:91
#: eb59e504789a45d5a703d405420b9a3a
msgid ""
"读取 `CELL| Vector a/b/c [angstrom]`、`MODULE QUICKSTEP: ATOMIC COORDINATES "
"IN ANGSTROM`、Hartree 能量、原子单位力和 GPa stress，并转换到 eV、Å 和 eV/"
"Å³。"
msgstr ""
"The importer reads `CELL| Vector a/b/c [angstrom]`, `MODULE QUICKSTEP: "
"ATOMIC COORDINATES IN ANGSTROM`, Hartree energy, forces in atomic units, and "
"stress in GPa, then converts them to eV, Å, and eV/Å³."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:94
#: 04213202fee14b9bb1451e48d36bc177
msgid ""
"缺少完整 cell、没有坐标、力数量不一致、cell 退化或含多个坐标/力块时会明确失"
"败。"
msgstr ""
"Import fails explicitly when the complete cell or coordinates are missing, "
"the force count does not match, the cell is degenerate, or multiple "
"coordinate or force blocks are present."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:95
#: 3787ad74766b478bb52cbf738f7d8068
msgid ""
"当前 CP2K 主输出入口记录 `pbc=\"T T T\"`，因此不要用于 `PERIODIC NONE` 或部分"
"周期计算。 这类计算应从 CP2K 导出带明确 `Lattice` 和 `pbc` 的 EXTXYZ 后再导"
"入。"
msgstr ""
"The current CP2K main-output entry point records `pbc=\"T T T\"`; do not use "
"it for `PERIODIC NONE` or partially periodic calculations. Export those "
"calculations from CP2K as EXTXYZ with explicit `Lattice` and `pbc`, then "
"import that file."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:98
#: fce4840c3d4344ecadb8da123e0fa17f
msgid ""
"CP2K 的几何优化文档也建议使用轨迹或最终结构文件承载多步几何；主输出并不是完整"
"轨迹容器。"
msgstr ""
"The CP2K geometry-optimization documentation likewise recommends trajectory "
"or final-structure files for multi-step geometries; the main output is not a "
"complete trajectory container."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:100
#: 550bc8e2169f42c9aa138032daf536c8
msgid "n2p2 `input.data`"
msgstr "n2p2 `input.data`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:102
#: 898a723584a84f368d7659a712883b4c
msgid "支持名为 `input.data` 的文件以及 `.data` / `.cfg` 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Files named `input.data` and files with `.data` or `.cfg` extensions are "
"supported."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:103
#: 1da23cfa1d6c4e63b772d95d4b816c3f
msgid ""
"结构块必须由 `begin` / `end` 完整包围；每个 atom 行严格包含位置、元素、电荷、"
"逐原子能量 和三维力。"
msgstr ""
"Every structure block must be enclosed by `begin` and `end`. Each atom row "
"must contain position, element, charge, per-atom energy, and a three-"
"dimensional force."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:105
#: c934b2591ec248bc8de1e808525c0383
msgid "n2p2 CFG 数值按 Bohr / Hartree 读取，并转换为 Å、eV 和 eV/Å。"
msgstr ""
"n2p2 CFG values are read in Bohr and Hartree, then converted to Å, eV, and "
"eV/Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:106
#: bcb2ac491f7d4d738090041a8ebfd4ea
msgid ""
"0 或 3 行 lattice 都是合法契约；只有 1–2 行 lattice、损坏数值、非法元素或缺"
"少 `end` 会使整次导入失败。"
msgstr ""
"Either zero or three lattice rows form a valid contract. One or two lattice "
"rows, damaged numeric values, invalid elements, or a missing `end` marker "
"cause the entire import to fail."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:109
#: da012cab22ee45c8a27a7005cccb2e6d
msgid "LAMMPS"
msgstr "LAMMPS"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:111
#: 604f15d7a3634cdbacbbbed5bd96aa96
msgid "`dump`"
msgstr "`dump`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:112
#: e6580de4ac264f3d9463eb7eacbe752a
msgid "`lammpstrj`"
msgstr "`lammpstrj`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:114
#: 99836f80ad634a64b6856ded629bcb8e
msgid ""
"支持正交和三斜晶胞，以及常见坐标列。导入后建议先抽查晶胞、元素类型和坐标单位"
"是否符合预期。 每一帧必须包含完整的 `BOX BOUNDS` 边界标志、一个完整坐标三元组"
"（`xs/ys/zs`、 `x/y/z` 或 `xu/yu/zu`）以及 `element` 或 `type` 列。仅有数值 "
"`type` 时，需要由导入 界面或调用方提供完整的“类型编号 → 元素”映射；"
"NepTrainKit 不会把未知类型替换成伪元素。 原子行截断、非法元素、缺失映射或退化"
"晶胞都会使整次导入明确失败，不会返回不完整轨迹。"
msgstr ""
"Orthogonal and triclinic cells and the common coordinate columns are "
"supported. After import, spot-check the cell, element types, and coordinate "
"units. Every frame must provide complete `BOX BOUNDS` boundary flags, one "
"complete coordinate triplet (`xs/ys/zs`, `x/y/z`, or `xu/yu/zu`), and an "
"`element` or `type` column. A dump containing only numeric `type` values "
"requires a complete type-number-to-element mapping from the import UI or "
"caller; NepTrainKit never substitutes pseudo-elements for unknown types. "
"Truncated atom rows, invalid elements, missing mappings, or degenerate cells "
"fail the entire import instead of returning a partial trajectory."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:120
#: c62be8bc317548448156a10888b8228d
msgid "带自旋的推荐 dump"
msgstr "Recommended dump format with spins"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:122
#: 785ac3a786a34d838194a541f9d483f5
msgid "使用 spin LAMMPS 时，推荐按下面的列名输出磁矩："
msgstr ""
"When using spin LAMMPS, use the following column names to output magnetic "
"moments:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:124
#: 159afe260ff14c2a9c46e7a2f29997e7
msgid ""
"compute spin all property/atom sp spx spy spz fmx fmy fmz fx fy fz\n"
"dump dpgen_dump all custom 100 traj.dump id type x y z c_spin[1] c_spin[2] "
"c_spin[3] c_spin[4] c_spin[5] c_spin[6] c_spin[7]\n"
msgstr ""
"compute spin all property/atom sp spx spy spz fmx fmy fmz fx fy fz\n"
"dump dpgen_dump all custom 100 traj.dump id type x y z c_spin[1] c_spin[2] "
"c_spin[3] c_spin[4] c_spin[5] c_spin[6] c_spin[7]\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:129
#: 8caca967a3b7454e8c44c9a697b9125b
msgid ""
"导入器把 `c_spin[1]` 解释为磁矩模长，把 `c_spin[2]`、`c_spin[3]`、"
"`c_spin[4]` 解释为三个方向分量，并重建逐原子自旋向量："
msgstr ""
"The importer treats `c_spin[1]` as the moment magnitude and `c_spin[2]`, "
"`c_spin[3]`, and `c_spin[4]` as the three direction components, then "
"reconstructs the per-atom spin vector:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:131
#: e26f2ea185af4fa9af803c2bb8627fd8
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf s_i=c_{\\mathrm{spin}[1]}\n"
"\\left(c_{\\mathrm{spin}[2]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[3]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[4]}"
"\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf s_i=c_{\\mathrm{spin}[1]}\n"
"\\left(c_{\\mathrm{spin}[2]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[3]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[4]}"
"\\right).\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:136
#: 655576535d7e4537a2d22e3bf3990a0d
msgid ""
"`c_spin[5]`、`c_spin[6]`、`c_spin[7]` 是磁力分量，不会写入 `spin:R:3`。如果缺"
"少 `c_spin[1:4]` 中任意一列，导入器不会为该帧生成自旋字段。"
msgstr ""
"`c_spin[5]`, `c_spin[6]`, and `c_spin[7]` are magnetic-force components and "
"are not written to `spin:R:3`. If any column in `c_spin[1:4]` is missing, "
"the importer does not create a spin field for that frame."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:138
#: 209b661642244e0eab47b7e0c821653a
msgid "导出"
msgstr "Export"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:140
#: 0456fc4e3f0c43668688bfac513b2b8d
msgid "`NEP Dataset Display` 可以把当前数据导出为两类结果："
msgstr "`NEP Dataset Display` can export the current data in two main forms:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:142
#: 1b5807f59ebb49c495ef6b45514a6320
msgid "`xyz` / `extxyz`：适合继续回到 GPUMD、ASE 或 生成数据集 流程。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:143
#: 4bd873aa9f3d4a0381ff25a9c1a82803
msgid ""
"`deepmd/npy`：适合接入 DeepMD 风格数据管理；是否保留导入时的子目录层级由 "
"`Settings → Keep DeepMD subfolders` 控制。"
msgstr ""
"`deepmd/npy`: suitable for DeepMD-style data management. `Settings → Keep "
"DeepMD subfolders` controls whether the imported subdirectory hierarchy is "
"preserved."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:145
#: c464c98c8585408585f5b457c0d76352
msgid ""
"导出 `deepmd/npy` 时，NepTrainKit 会保留全周期或全非周期 PBC；全非周期目录写"
"入 `nopbc`。同一 `Config_type` 下的结构必须具有一致的元素/原子数、PBC、逐原子"
"字段和 能量/virial 覆盖。DeepMD 标准目录不能无歧义表示部分周期边界或同一目录"
"中的混合契约， 遇到这些输入时导出会在写文件前失败。逐原子整数、逻辑和字符串字"
"段会按原类型往返， 原子顺序则按 `type_map` 规范化。"
msgstr ""
"When exporting `deepmd/npy`, NepTrainKit preserves fully periodic or fully "
"nonperiodic PBC; a fully nonperiodic directory receives a `nopbc` marker. "
"Structures sharing a `Config_type` must have consistent elements and atom "
"count, PBC, per-atom fields, and energy/virial coverage. Because the "
"standard DeepMD directory format cannot unambiguously represent partial PBC "
"or mixed contracts in one directory, such inputs fail before any files are "
"written. Per-atom integer, logical, and string fields round-trip with their "
"original types, while atom order is canonicalized by `type_map`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:151
#: 6c66e419187f4fff91576fdb4a8d7baa
msgid "大数据和导入说明"
msgstr "Large datasets and import behavior"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:153
#: eca924e0333e4f0a96a426086b283fea
msgid ""
"大数据集导入时，界面显示可能做抽样或延迟渲染；底层选择和导出仍以完整数据为"
"准。"
msgstr ""
"For a large dataset, the interface may sample or defer rendering for "
"responsiveness. Selection and export still operate on the complete dataset."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:154
#: 820f2944709a48e19c70122282ce1598
msgid "导入过程支持中断。"
msgstr "You can cancel an import while it is running."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/formats.md:155
#: 0016861e50e942fbba54e2956649bb5a
msgid ""
"不同来源的文件最好保留清晰命名，例如 `candidate_pool.xyz`、"
"`candidate_pool_clean.xyz`、`dft_labeled.xyz`。"
msgstr ""
"Use descriptive names for files from different stages, such as "
"`candidate_pool.xyz`, `candidate_pool_clean.xyz`, and `dft_labeled.xyz`."

